# Even Odd Args

A simple Go CLI application that checks whether the number of command-line arguments is even or odd.

## Requirements

- Go 1.20+

## Run

```bash
go run . one two three
```

Output:

```
I have an odd number of arguments
```

Example:

```bash
go run . one two
```

Output:

```
I have an even number of arguments
```

## Build

```bash
go build -o even-odd-args
```

Run the executable:

```bash
./even-odd-args apple banana
```
